Package: simpleTaxonomy
Title: Create Interactive Visualisation of Taxonomic Hierarchy
Version: 0.1.0.9008
Authors@R: 
    person("Stefan", "Lanz", , "slanz1137@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Create interactive visualisations of a taxonomy hierarchy that is
  specified in a csv file using a simple format. The visualisation uses
  the javascript library D3.js via the R package collapsibleTree.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://stibu81.github.io/simpleTaxonomy/
